{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のちはるーむではみんなで今流行りの和風アイスを食べました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は女性の日。\nショートの日。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1946年のこの日に、戦後の総選挙で初めて婦人参政権が行使されたからです。\n記念すべき日だなあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ショートの日は、4と10の語呂合わせから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロングのイメージが多い私ですが\n高2の時に半年ほどショートというか\nボブというか...\n短い時があったのです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/04/11/3656413/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは前髪を耳にかけているので\n前髪あるように見えますが\nワンレングスでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今とは真逆だね(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/04/11/3656413/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう３年前なので雰囲気も違うかな◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日の真夏のブログに\n生写真撮影の合間の私たちの写真が！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/04/11/3656413/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぶちゅ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"の他にも..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/04/11/3656413/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪の毛でも遊んでいたら..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついに真夏も反撃に移りました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/04/11/3656413/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地味に握力の強い真夏が\n全力で腕を握ってきて\nさらに食べようとまでしてきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握った跡が腕に残ったのは\n面白かったねヽ(；；)丿笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仲良し真夏です☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"------------------------------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「流星」コブクロさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名曲。\nいつ聞いても素敵だし\nロマンティックだし\n本当良い曲だな〜\n歌詞もメロディも声も全部素敵。\n\"君より綺麗な人でも 君より優しい人でも\n君にはなれないんだ もう誰も\"\n頑張ろうって思える。\nどんなに嫌になっても\n私は私でしかないし代わりはいない。\n頑張ろ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もChihAnswer募集します☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってます〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}